<node id="IC_product">
  <data key="d0">IC_product</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">IC products refers to the core foundational component widely used in in a wide range of sectors such as household appliances, communication devices, computers, industrial control, automotive, military defense the military. The demand for IC productsst can be influenced by macroeconomic factors.&lt;SEP&gt;IC products is the foundation of modern electronics and is widely used in a range of sectors like home appliances, communication devices, computers, industrial control, automotive, military military the military, its market demand is easily affected by macroeconomic conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;IC product product foundation for modern electronics, widely used in various sectors. Its demand is affected by macroeconomic fluctuations.&lt;SEP&gt;IC products widely used in various sectors, its demand is easily influenced by macroeconomic fluctuations.&lt;SEP&gt;IC产品是指现代电子工业的基础，广泛应用于包括家用电器、通讯设备、计算机、工业控制、汽车、军工在内的国民经济各领域，其市场需求容易受到宏观经济波动的影响。&lt;SEP&gt;IC产品是现代电子工业的基础，广泛应用于包括家用电器、通讯设备、计算机、工业控制、汽车、军工在内的国民经济各领域，其市场需求容易受到宏观经济波动的影响。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bfaf744ac408f85bc3ee2143f0c68493-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">ÕÐ¹ÉËµÃ÷Êé2.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1781161251</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
