<edge source="#|&lt;Company" target="&lt;Company">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The the company distributes the remaining profits to shareholders according to their sharehold before extracting optional surplus from the remaining profits.&lt;SEP&gt;The the company must use surplus to compensate for losses or expand production and operations or not for compensating for losses.&lt;SEP&gt;The the company must complete profit distribution once one month after the shareholders' meeting approve the distribution plan.&lt;SEP&gt;&lt;The the company must retain a sufficient ratio of surplus from capital increase to ensure the company's capital structure.&lt;SEP&gt;&lt;The company adheres to a continuous and stable profit distribution policy.</data>
  <data key="d9">#|&lt;company公积金补偿亏损扩大生产经营或转增资本后不得用于补偿亏损,#|&lt;company必须在股东大会决议通过股利派发方案一个月内完成股利派发,#|&lt;company执行持续稳定的利润分配政策,#|&lt;company按股东持股比例分配利润后提取任意公积金按股东持股比例分配多余税后利润,#|&lt;company转增资本留存的公积金不少于转增前的注册资本比例留存以保障公司资本结构健康稳定</data>
